    "end": 9.857,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Nomura",
      "slowdown",
      "China"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "sales for May.",
    "start": 9.857,
    "end": 14.06,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Nomura",
      "slowdown",
      "China"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "That’s right. The headline number\nis a decline of about 21.6%\nyear-on-year in domestic passenger\ncar retail sales volume for May.",
    "start": 14.42,
    "end": 22.268,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "21.6%",
      "year-on-year",
      "domestic passenger car retail sales"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "That’s a pretty steep drop. What’s\ndriving this?",
    "start": 22.628,
    "end": 25.043,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "steep drop"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "The report points to a couple of\nkey factors. One is a payback\neffect from the scaled-back\ntrade-in program.",
    "start": 25.403,
    "end": 30.883,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "payback effect",
      "trade-in program"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "The other is the rise in the EV\npurchase tax from zero to 5%.",
    "start": 31.243,
    "end": 35.283,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "EV purchase tax",
      "5%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So the policy side incentives that\nwere boosting sales are now being\nunwound, and that’s hitting demand\nhard.",
    "start": 35.643,
    "end": 42.423,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "unwound",
      "demand"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Exactly. The domestic market is\nacting as a major drag. And the\nreport notes that the auto sector\naccounts for over 3% of China’s",
    "start": 42.783,
    "end": 46.568,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "domestic market",
      "drag",
      "auto sector"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "GDP,",
    "start": 46.568,
    "end": 50.353,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "domestic market",
      "drag",
      "auto sector"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "so this matters for the broader\neconomy.",
