    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "energy disruptions",
      "Chinese carmakers",
      "advantages"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "So the export story is strong, but\ncan it fully compensate for the\ndomestic slump?",
